Newly Refurbished Lovely Property – Northolt (UB5)

We are delighted to present this beautifully refurbished house in the heart of Northolt (UB5) – perfect for professionals looking for comfort, convenience, and community living.

£170.00 per week for one person only
Available NOW!

* Property Features:

- Spacious house share with 2 modern bathrooms;
- Driveway with parking for 2 cars;
- Large back garden – perfect for relaxing or socialising;
- Fully equipped, modern kitchen with ample storage and dining space; Wasing machine and drier
- Bright, fully furnished rooms with quality furniture;
- Newly refurbished to a high standard;

* Location Highlights:

- Excellent access to local amenities – supermarkets, shops, cafes, and restaurants;

* Great transport links:

- Northolt Station (Central Line) is just a short distance away;
- Easy access to the A40 for fast routes into Central London;
- Close to major bus routes for added convenience;
- Green spaces and gyms nearby; enjoy a healthy lifestyle in a friendly residential neighbourhood.

* What’s Included in the Rent:

- All bills included (electricity, water, gas, council tax);
- Superfast Wi-Fi;
- Regular cleaning of communal areas;
- Access to shared kitchen and bathrooms;

Don’t Miss Out!

Contact us today to arrange a viewing and secure your room!
